      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The old loading screen has been brought back in [VRChat 2026.1.3](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202613) (March 31, 2026) for active VRC+ subscribers.\n\n(Duplicate feature request.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
